  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The time path clone faces Jumping Time Fish Tribulation. Fang Yuan leaves the tribulation’s time path dao marks in the clone’s immortal aperture. The clone says he now has rank eight cultivation and that from now onwards he shall use the name He Chun Qiu. Fang Yuan’s main body replies that it is up to him. Among Fang Yuan’s eight clones, Qi Sea Ancestor, Wu Shuai, the time path clone He Chun Qiu, and Zhan Bu Du have advanced to rank eight.",
      "chapters": [
        2137
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor",
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "char_zhan_bu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He Chun Qiu brings news that Wu clan’s fan wind Gu was advanced successfully, though it failed two times in the process.",
      "chapters": [
        2142
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-and-aperture-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "gu_fan_wind_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan enters Crazed Demon Cave and collects immortal materials, he orders the time path clone He Chun Qiu to use Four Elements Square Regret Blood Refinement Pool to refine Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        2178
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-and-aperture-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "house_four_elements_square_regret_blood_refinement_pool",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the sovereign immortal aperture he places jade green water flow as a Mini Eastern Sea resource point and water vein node, sets an immortal formation, heals rank six Gu Immortals with a time path killer move, and is counted among the strongest people available for hard aperture work with Wu Shuai and peer rank eights.",
      "chapters": [
        2229
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-and-aperture-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_eastern_sea",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When black fire spreads, He Chun Qiu activates a human path formation. Human path killer moves are effective but cannot compare to the black fire’s growth, and the fire reaches Dang Hun Mountain, Luo Po Valley, and the earth vein formation.",
      "chapters": [
        2205
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "human-path-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_human",
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Within the sovereign immortal aperture he uses time path killer moves, including methods that draw River of Time water into the year essence pool to raise aperture time flow for Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus refinement work. Because he used too many time path methods in that period, he has to recuperate and rest. He later takes station at Four Elements Square Regret Blood Refinement Pool with Wu Shuai and hairy man Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        2231
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "time-flow-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "gu_heavenly_essence_treasure_lotus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan again orders him to raise sovereign immortal aperture time flow, and the result is that He Chun Qiu’s time path dao marks are all used up in the process.",
      "chapters": [
        2232
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-marks-exhausted",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration later states that for that purpose his time path foundation was almost entirely used up.",
      "chapters": [
        2253
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-marks-exhausted",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
